| FS-9 | KEEP | Clear dotglob behavior. Cue is strong but valid. |
| FS-10 | FIX | Gold is clear, but rendered artifacts have avoidable formatting tells. |
| DB-5 | KEEP | Strong SQLite name-resolution item; prompt evidence sufficient. |
